(6946372, 1046775, 136989, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! Great details in the trees and the abstract reflections are terrific.  I particularly like the hint of blue in the sky.</td>', 'Gorgeous! Great details in the trees and the abstract reflections are terrific.  I particularly like the hint of blue in the sky.', '2013-01-01 13:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946374, 1044528, 136989, '<td valign="top">Great mix of misty hills with the vivid detail and colors of the umbrella.  The highlights from the road add depth and the hint of movement kin the figure pull it all together.</td>', 'Great mix of misty hills with the vivid detail and colors of the umbrella.  The highlights from the road add depth and the hint of movement kin the figure pull it all together.', '2013-01-01 13:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946418, 1047101, 115644, '<td valign="top">a bit over saturated imo. i would try to get rid of the chromatic aberrations as well. i wonder how this image would work in black and white.</td>', 'a bit over saturated imo. i would try to get rid of the chromatic aberrations as well. i wonder how this image would work in black and white.', '2013-01-01 14:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946438, 1045194, 18197, '<td valign="top">Stunning image. But I would like this better without the border.</td>', 'Stunning image. But I would like this better without the border.', '2013-01-01 14:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946446, 1044511, 156757, '<td valign="top">Just curious, was it your intention in post production to make this scene look unrealistic?</td>', 'Just curious, was it your intention in post production to make this scene look unrealistic?', '2013-01-01 15:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946451, 1046883, 42256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lines. 8, would have been a 10 if it was cropped from the right.</td>', 'Beautiful lines. 8, would have been a 10 if it was cropped from the right.', '2013-01-01 15:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946461, 1046444, 114225, '<td valign="top">Awesome use of shadows and backlight.</td>', 'Awesome use of shadows and backlight.', '2013-01-01 15:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946462, 1047232, 114225, '<td valign="top">This image has some story to it. However, I find the composition to be flat.</td>', 'This image has some story to it. However, I find the composition to be flat.', '2013-01-01 15:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946465, 1046453, 114225, '<td valign="top">I find myself wishing that this was clearer. The noise is really taking away a lot of clarity.</td>', 'I find myself wishing that this was clearer. The noise is really taking away a lot of clarity.', '2013-01-01 15:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946469, 1047140, 114225, '<td valign="top">Are those beats rotten? Or is that look caused by post processing?<br/>Either way, rotten food is hard to make look good in a photo.</td>', 'Are those beats rotten? Or is that look caused by post processing?Either way, rotten food is hard to make look good in a photo.', '2013-01-01 15:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946470, 1047274, 114225, '<td valign="top">Those little things are hard to photograph, which is why I''m guessing that the face is a bit soft (seems like the focus point is on the wing).</td>', 'Those little things are hard to photograph, which is why I''m guessing that the face is a bit soft (seems like the focus point is on the wing).', '2013-01-01 15:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946472, 1046743, 114225, '<td valign="top">A very classic image, much like an oil painting.</td>', 'A very classic image, much like an oil painting.', '2013-01-01 15:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946474, 1046878, 114225, '<td valign="top">That is an interesting choice in perspective. A lot of negative space that I''m not sure if it helps or hurts.<br/> <br/>Don''t you hate that these balls always pick up such intense reflections from your lighting?</td>', 'That is an interesting choice in perspective. A lot of negative space that I''m not sure if it helps or hurts. Don''t you hate that these balls always pick up such intense reflections from your lighting?', '2013-01-01 15:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946476, 1047377, 114225, '<td valign="top">The combination of gold and blue is very nice.</td>', 'The combination of gold and blue is very nice.', '2013-01-01 15:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946478, 1045701, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the overall style and light, but find it too bad that here left eye is hiding in the dark.</td>', 'I like the overall style and light, but find it too bad that here left eye is hiding in the dark.', '2013-01-01 15:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946479, 1047141, 114225, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of perspective and narrow band crop.</td>', 'Excellent use of perspective and narrow band crop.', '2013-01-01 15:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946481, 1046677, 114225, '<td valign="top">A very nice portrait of a wonderful animal.</td>', 'A very nice portrait of a wonderful animal.', '2013-01-01 15:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946483, 1046701, 114225, '<td valign="top">Those dead trees give this a very eerie look.</td>', 'Those dead trees give this a very eerie look.', '2013-01-01 15:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946484, 1046663, 114225, '<td valign="top">That a very sweet portrait.</td>', 'That a very sweet portrait.', '2013-01-01 15:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946485, 1046070, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, the editing effect makes this look like intense lighting.</td>', 'Wow, the editing effect makes this look like intense lighting.', '2013-01-01 15:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946486, 1046512, 114225, '<td valign="top">Oh, that''s just lovely!</td>', 'Oh, that''s just lovely!', '2013-01-01 15:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946487, 1046987, 114225, '<td valign="top">The birds add so much to this already great photo.</td>', 'The birds add so much to this already great photo.', '2013-01-01 15:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946488, 1047297, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and photo, but find myself wondering what this could be with a longer exposure to get streaking clouds.</td>', 'I like the idea and photo, but find myself wondering what this could be with a longer exposure to get streaking clouds.', '2013-01-01 15:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946489, 1047188, 114225, '<td valign="top">Awe, how cute!</td>', 'Awe, how cute!', '2013-01-01 15:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946491, 1047230, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a great slinky abstract.</td>', 'This is a great slinky abstract.', '2013-01-01 15:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946492, 1045942, 114225, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful use of natural framing.</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful use of natural framing.', '2013-01-01 15:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946513, 1047320, 114225, '<td valign="top">A good way to ring in the year.<br/>Photographically speaking, this is pretty flat. The use of paper for a background that is close to your subject makes for the subject and background having no real separation.</td>', 'A good way to ring in the year.Photographically speaking, this is pretty flat. The use of paper for a background that is close to your subject makes for the subject and background having no real separation.', '2013-01-01 16:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946515, 1046278, 114225, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous scene. I wonder why you went with a small image size when a larger could show many more details.</td>', 'Gorgeous scene. I wonder why you went with a small image size when a larger could show many more details.', '2013-01-01 16:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946516, 1047336, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great abstract.</td>', 'Great abstract.', '2013-01-01 16:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946517, 1046426, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely color compliments in this.</td>', 'Lovely color compliments in this.', '2013-01-01 16:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946518, 1046130, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good use of IR to give some mystery.</td>', 'Good use of IR to give some mystery.', '2013-01-01 16:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946519, 1047089, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of pastel colors throughout. I''m not too fond of the panty hoes, as they seem to take away a bit of the class. Overall very nice.</td>', 'Lovely use of pastel colors throughout. I''m not too fond of the panty hoes, as they seem to take away a bit of the class. Overall very nice.', '2013-01-01 16:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946520, 1045963, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow! What an amazing natural painting.</td>', 'Wow! What an amazing natural painting.', '2013-01-01 16:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946521, 1047275, 114225, '<td valign="top">Ha, what a great sight to capture.</td>', 'Ha, what a great sight to capture.', '2013-01-01 16:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946522, 1045938, 114225, '<td valign="top">Building like this are so cool. Too bad there are footsteps in the clean snow.</td>', 'Building like this are so cool. Too bad there are footsteps in the clean snow.', '2013-01-01 16:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946523, 1046775, 114225, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, the pristine white of the beginning of winter. Nice.</td>', 'Ahhh, the pristine white of the beginning of winter. Nice.', '2013-01-01 16:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946524, 1046771, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great vantage point. What are the hills in the background tinted black at the tops? IS that something that happening in post processing?</td>', 'Great vantage point. What are the hills in the background tinted black at the tops? IS that something that happening in post processing?', '2013-01-01 16:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946525, 1046745, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a menacing scene, made even grander by the use of B&amp;W.</td>', 'What a menacing scene, made even grander by the use of B&W.', '2013-01-01 16:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6946526, 1047367, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is nothing short of impressive.</td>', 'Wow, that is nothing short of impressive.', '2013-01-01 16:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
