(6947422, 1046745, 54446, '<td valign="top">Amazing atmospherics, photographed and converted to b&amp;w like a master.  It''s that lighthouse light in the fog above the surf which makes this magical.  I expect this will be a ribbon contender.  9</td>', 'Amazing atmospherics, photographed and converted to b&w like a master.  It''s that lighthouse light in the fog above the surf which makes this magical.  I expect this will be a ribbon contender.  9', '2013-01-02 13:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
