(6948296, 1047062, 66952, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice, sharp, well lit picture, of a guy in a suit sitting in front of a white wall, looking away from the camera. The technicals are good, but as the viewer, I''m just not that interested in the guy. He isn''t engaged with the camera and isn''t doing anything interesting, and there''s nothing about the environment he''s in that''s interesting. The angle (from slightly above) and the fact that he isn''t looking at the camera makes me think that this is probably a grab shot, of a guy who''s waiting for either a funeral, a wedding, or a job interview. Maybe it would have been more interesting to show a wider shot of him in the environment.</td>', 'It''s a nice, sharp, well lit picture, of a guy in a suit sitting in front of a white wall, looking away from the camera. The technicals are good, but as the viewer, I''m just not that interested in the guy. He isn''t engaged with the camera and isn''t doing anything interesting, and there''s nothing about the environment he''s in that''s interesting. The angle (from slightly above) and the fact that he isn''t looking at the camera makes me think that this is probably a grab shot, of a guy who''s waiting for either a funeral, a wedding, or a job interview. Maybe it would have been more interesting to show a wider shot of him in the environment.', '2013-01-03 15:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
