(6949574, 1044599, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well seen and captured!  Not quite sure about the aspect ratio with the extra negative space to the left.  I get what you were going for but IMO it makes this a little too off balance.</td>', 'Well seen and captured!  Not quite sure about the aspect ratio with the extra negative space to the left.  I get what you were going for but IMO it makes this a little too off balance.', '2013-01-05 12:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
