(6951322, 1046454, 86218, '<td valign="top">Great shot Dennis. Majestic, well processed and the lines work for me furthered by the conversion here. Clouds/hint of it rounds the sky off nicely as just the sky would have been a tad bland. Love the trees breaking the ridge framing the background mountains together with the Triangular shaped "theme" complemented by the trees as seen in the mountains. Strong image compositionally. No bling needed for this to catch the eye</td>', 'Great shot Dennis. Majestic, well processed and the lines work for me furthered by the conversion here. Clouds/hint of it rounds the sky off nicely as just the sky would have been a tad bland. Love the trees breaking the ridge framing the background mountains together with the Triangular shaped "theme" complemented by the trees as seen in the mountains. Strong image compositionally. No bling needed for this to catch the eye', '2013-01-07 12:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
