(6952217, 1047302, 108580, '<td valign="top">Predominantly black subjects are notoriously difficult to expose correctly. You did well on this to get details in the feathers and not OE the entire scene. Even more difficult in flight. Well captured and good focus on the head/eye Rian. I agree with nam, the horison is unfortunate that it slices the bird and is distracting. Had it not been for that I''d have given an 8 but ended with a 7 instead.</td>', 'Predominantly black subjects are notoriously difficult to expose correctly. You did well on this to get details in the feathers and not OE the entire scene. Even more difficult in flight. Well captured and good focus on the head/eye Rian. I agree with nam, the horison is unfortunate that it slices the bird and is distracting. Had it not been for that I''d have given an 8 but ended with a 7 instead.', '2013-01-08 06:04:23.000000', NULL, 0),
