(6952410, 1046444, 18563, '<td valign="top">Wow! I think this is my first top 10 in FS! Thanks for all the comments!!!<br/> <br/>This was a staged shot for an engagement session I was doing for a couple. When I saw this old elevator I knew I had to somehow incorporate it into our shoot. The lighting was simple: 1xSB910 set at 1/2 power held in the left hand of the girl connected by PW''s. The lighting you see on the far right wall from the strobe shooting through the metal bars on the elevator cage.<br/> <br/>In retrospect, I really should have fixed the lighting coming from the hall on the far left side....oh well, next time</td>', 'Wow! I think this is my first top 10 in FS! Thanks for all the comments!!! This was a staged shot for an engagement session I was doing for a couple. When I saw this old elevator I knew I had to somehow incorporate it into our shoot. The lighting was simple: 1xSB910 set at 1/2 power held in the left hand of the girl connected by PW''s. The lighting you see on the far right wall from the strobe shooting through the metal bars on the elevator cage. In retrospect, I really should have fixed the lighting coming from the hall on the far left side....oh well, next time', '2013-01-08 11:27:54.000000', NULL, 0),
