(6953006, 1047374, 93565, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t have pegged this as the last of the lot, myself. Though it eschews many aspects of the DPC aesthetic, it''s still a compelling enough image I''d have figured an ambiguous 5.0 finish.<br/> <br/>Anyway, to echo those who have already commented, I love how brooding this image is. It reminds me of the intro to Fight Club perhaps, and also <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=892269" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/17507/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_892269.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/17507/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_892269.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/17507/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_892269.jpg"/></a>. But yours is dirtier, more sinister. I like it. Funny how just some twigs and cardboard could be so evocative...</td>', 'Wouldn''t have pegged this as the last of the lot, myself. Though it eschews many aspects of the DPC aesthetic, it''s still a compelling enough image I''d have figured an ambiguous 5.0 finish. Anyway, to echo those who have already commented, I love how brooding this image is. It reminds me of the intro to Fight Club perhaps, and also . But yours is dirtier, more sinister. I like it. Funny how just some twigs and cardboard could be so evocative...', '2013-01-08 21:54:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6953124, 1046663, 109363, '<td valign="top">hey, i got first place with this photo over <a href="//www.dpreview.com/challenges/Entry.aspx?ID=695147&amp;View=Results&amp;Rows=4" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here</a></td>', 'hey, i got first place with this photo over here', '2013-01-08 23:13:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6953154, 1045942, 39057, '<td valign="top">Your place was about where it should have finished. The first and third place are my favorites. I''m not really fond of the second place photo. <br/>The branch on the left that reaches into the middle of the photo is a little blurry. IMO the photo would have been better without that branch poking into the middle. However, I do realize that it may have been impossible to remove. I have no idea how hard it would have been to get your clipper on it.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kenskid:</b></div><hr/><i> Looks like the branch on the left is a little out of focus. To bad you couldn''t focus stack this. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Looks just fine to me.  Maybe you should spread your "love" around to others.  You''ve harassed me enough. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Your place was about where it should have finished. The first and third place are my favorites. I''m not really fond of the second place photo. The branch on the left that reaches into the middle of the photo is a little blurry. IMO the photo would have been better without that branch poking into the middle. However, I do realize that it may have been impossible to remove. I have no idea how hard it would have been to get your clipper on it. Originally posted by hahn23: Originally posted by kenskid: Looks like the branch on the left is a little out of focus. To bad you couldn''t focus stack this.  Looks just fine to me.  Maybe you should spread your "love" around to others.  You''ve harassed me enough. ', '2013-01-09 00:02:57.000000', NULL, 0),
