(6954861, 1047371, 108580, '<td valign="top">Scott, as you know I''m not enamoured with massive zoom range telephotos for wildlife as they generally only have one sweet spot in FL and aperture cramping style and chances, however this is damn good for an all-in-wonder lens. Naturally camera and lens control must be the prime goal for any photographer to get the shot with whatever is in your bag and you have done that masterfully here. (What''s it like in low light?)</td>', 'Scott, as you know I''m not enamoured with massive zoom range telephotos for wildlife as they generally only have one sweet spot in FL and aperture cramping style and chances, however this is damn good for an all-in-wonder lens. Naturally camera and lens control must be the prime goal for any photographer to get the shot with whatever is in your bag and you have done that masterfully here. (What''s it like in low light?)', '2013-01-11 02:03:20.000000', NULL, 0),
