(6957721, 1047303, 93565, '<td valign="top">Bit blue on the WB, the colors and focus look a bit odd on their "decorations." Maybe a bit overexposed in some areas, but it''s obvious you were getting just enough for the hair, so it''s hard to say. Lots of dynamic range here, so it''s tough to photograph. A great moment, regardless, but the decorations make it a tough choice so far as where and how to crop. As is, I feel like I want to crop closer, but that would get rid of the decorations and then would be... odd. A bit wider context, like waist up, might help things here.</td>', 'Bit blue on the WB, the colors and focus look a bit odd on their "decorations." Maybe a bit overexposed in some areas, but it''s obvious you were getting just enough for the hair, so it''s hard to say. Lots of dynamic range here, so it''s tough to photograph. A great moment, regardless, but the decorations make it a tough choice so far as where and how to crop. As is, I feel like I want to crop closer, but that would get rid of the decorations and then would be... odd. A bit wider context, like waist up, might help things here.', '2013-01-15 03:05:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6957723, 1047216, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very much like the switch up with the different take on the floral shot. I wonder what tons of other compositions and lighting schemes would yield, but I''m sure you went there and tried that. I might consider a higher level of abstraction, getting closer, making one wonder what the heck that is, perhaps tilting the rose so it descends out of focus into the distance? Something, anyway, to drive home the peculiar look. Very neat, nice lighting, but lacks some pow factor.</td>', 'Very much like the switch up with the different take on the floral shot. I wonder what tons of other compositions and lighting schemes would yield, but I''m sure you went there and tried that. I might consider a higher level of abstraction, getting closer, making one wonder what the heck that is, perhaps tilting the rose so it descends out of focus into the distance? Something, anyway, to drive home the peculiar look. Very neat, nice lighting, but lacks some pow factor.', '2013-01-15 03:10:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(6957725, 1046701, 93565, '<td valign="top">I don''t want to say that I don''t like this, because I do. Having said that, I do want to say that I think you''ve been here (figuratively) before, that you''ve pursued a subject in this sense, that you''ve accomplished much already here and should move to push things in a different direction we haven''t seen. I liked the snowscape you showed us, because it defied many other things, because it was something you personally found interesting. I can''t help wondering which shot you personally liked more, which you were more curious and interested in.<br/> <br/>I don''t have anything negative to say other than that I have nothing to say to specifically differentiate it that I haven''t said for another photo. Other shots you''ve shown are differentiated for being yours, but this feels less so, but maybe that''s just me and my current mood. Who knows? :)</td>', 'I don''t want to say that I don''t like this, because I do. Having said that, I do want to say that I think you''ve been here (figuratively) before, that you''ve pursued a subject in this sense, that you''ve accomplished much already here and should move to push things in a different direction we haven''t seen. I liked the snowscape you showed us, because it defied many other things, because it was something you personally found interesting. I can''t help wondering which shot you personally liked more, which you were more curious and interested in. I don''t have anything negative to say other than that I have nothing to say to specifically differentiate it that I haven''t said for another photo. Other shots you''ve shown are differentiated for being yours, but this feels less so, but maybe that''s just me and my current mood. Who knows? :)', '2013-01-15 03:14:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6957788, 1047336, 119419, '<td valign="top">One of the really good ones</td>', 'One of the really good ones', '2013-01-15 06:59:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6958617, 1047303, 20799, '<td valign="top">I love it because it has the same feeling like your Mojito shot. About the discolorations and all, I know you like the 1.8 aperture :) but as I told you, I think it''s not the strongest side of this lens. Could also be the cause for the artifacts in harsh light.</td>', 'I love it because it has the same feeling like your Mojito shot. About the discolorations and all, I know you like the 1.8 aperture :) but as I told you, I think it''s not the strongest side of this lens. Could also be the cause for the artifacts in harsh light.', '2013-01-16 03:51:44.000000', NULL, 0),
